@startuml
title 時序圖 3：匯出 CSV（US3）
autonumber
actor "老師" as T
participant "API 層" as API
participant "ActivityResultsProvider" as R
participant "CSV 匯出" as E
T -> API : GET /api/activities/{id}/results.csv
API -> R : [權限檢查] get_result(id, 老師)（擁有者檢查）
alt 活動未結束
  API --> T : 409 INVALID_STATE
end
API -> E : to_csv(ActivityResult)
E -> E : 題組送出依填空拆列、依題號與順位排序、UTF-8 BOM
E --> API : CSV 內容與筆數
API --> T : 200 text/csv（X-Record-Count）
@enduml
